{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30007_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:30a7abd437fc900438e512dd8572c822503e88a9f530bbc5baabcedab4967bf7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:523976672ec17c53caacd258fbe23a9728f6c46221edfc6d9fa511e2b7ff60d5",
      "text": "炽热5人的挑战！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1113b913b9a5b567fb45b41f1c088f6efc193feb7a7fb386051e98ca14ae1764",
      "text": "315 Production在视频频道上\n开启的新企划。这次被选中的成员是\n实、锐心、隼人、龙、朱雀。\n初次一起工作的5人为了了解彼此，\n决定互相提出问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:523976672ec17c53caacd258fbe23a9728f6c46221edfc6d9fa511e2b7ff60d5",
      "text": "炽热5人的挑战！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a484064bdb87264ac479c300a530152a1b6e0de35e2fa6cfeedbf85eb9abdc0",
      "text": "打、打扰了。录制已经开始了吧。\n好紧张啊——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3929bd312a59bb8416e7d38b8300b72746f0f40f2ad274a3b240b486934d0a85",
      "text": "来，摄像机在那边哦。\n正在看视频的大家。你们好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a05d0c1492b349be0ebe4e5ebbf0ab73636811ea52d2b9bf590215a37d0f218",
      "text": "哦哦，这里就是平时拍摄用的房间吗！\n比想象中要宽敞啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07dca3fe479a88234a11ce9ceff97e09147b49c4672ec9436dec5fcc14c23639",
      "text": "嗯。自己能站在一直看视频的地方，\n感觉好不可思议啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f8e9d6eb0ed8d8332a6487c60d5255f8cef0551c211a51c34f55832c500e6f",
      "text": "座位顺序怎么定？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d6f4732238671b333679cee0d242c47fafb3b19ecade762c9de31af9eaa748",
      "text": "没有规定的话，\n按进来的顺序坐不就可以了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a126e6f9c58bf5cb34c7e4e1e5788b4585e4cd8e44acc9c28e43b4a7f980c5e",
      "text": "那我坐中间啦。\n好嘞，拿出干劲好好加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f65e157f0e30ba5072f7dd0d877b7e7fc12d987e8a0ef3e4f24f36c46a765ac8",
      "text": "那么重新来过……正在观看315 Production\n频道的各位，大家好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a8efa16552c3a3a6ce7146a43658f85f85a10b3364b1e969411b18fbbd875dc",
      "text": "这一次是这5个人。\n不知道有没有在大家的意料之中呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8f373e4d06317adb47ec04afa0a2af19fd19997ef803b4d3db0a2756bc5dc25",
      "text": "应该也有人觉得很意外吧？\n那么事不宜迟，来定企划……在这之前。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_a:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47a4a22738009fedfbdc7529a7442790a2f8d715b4152cebf1cce7ad75c08b0d",
      "text": "首先是自我介绍。这次可能也有\n第一次看这个频道的人呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ceaed64511aa93bbe860cfff02418e6142e7e16685dcc2888d7b7dce52d3da19",
      "text": "从我开始对吧。我是秋山隼人！\n在High×Joker里担任吉他手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:312db8af281a8f45bb5e827f57651c241ddbdc42b006dba3192b18322b47efe6",
      "text": "好的。我是Beit的渡边实。无论是在其他视频里\n认识我的，还是不认识我的，都请大家多多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d964b77e08cccf8302d6a906a180734a3de77282b1725b5b5dbd671c65eafe7c",
      "text": "哟！我是神速一魂的红井朱雀！\n这次也要燃烧起来，Burning！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1c8fb2c15934e9f917a4ed8d067176a859fe706eda7ae1b5d4ec882db0030c1",
      "text": "下一个是我。木村龙，20岁！\n所属组合是FRAME！请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc37e880242084c52e9704c84d683dee3da8eaf1361bd2e6d2718c6af5b6b864",
      "text": "我是C.FIRST的眉见锐心。请多关照。\n以上5名成员将进行这次企划。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1a247c8978aea6a7bc62da5524d464369af2fa3f263896df1fb446378c48188",
      "text": "不管哪一组都一样，凑成了出乎意料的\n成员阵容呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2786a1f1adee72e54ea2cc5116835e3852e604a42d2c811dbd71eb272b2d6296",
      "text": "是啊。企划敲定的时候，会跟谁搭档呢，\n我们在FRAME里也聊过这个话题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6386e92c384fe12e4443072524e4be50fd26c5374ea7c081caf56254c6d1c783",
      "text": "虽然跨组合的工作至今为止也有过，\n但以这个阵容合作，恐怕还是第一次吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af23a2cbd38c4aaae4e811a408863f8cb4146d218e24e9d5c00518238a8b8a3a",
      "text": "经你这么一说，好像确实是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54f3ac7ae3a889b8c0c5d258496b2345e8719b5e1adbcab9ef456fec8435f318",
      "text": "我有个提议。在开始企划之前，\n大家先稍微聊聊怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f195da3f3742be0ce7cfade04571c2eb44e8bb3fe9c44e96c3cef47f414f8ae",
      "text": "谈谈心里的想法，或者互相提问之类的。\n看视频的大家应该也很想听吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c557bfb7e3562ba855a02dc75d782744c2a1a7abbfc47a6f37bec19bf054e767",
      "text": "那主意好，就这么办！从知道是这个阵容\n起，我就有想问的事情了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fe2c0b646ed3c441b581e636dde97c299bdca172243c9f640538a4537c026a0",
      "text": "那么，红井先提问吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97f8d19a51b277386363576b521e24474682f459b82ee1e467fb301c068755ee",
      "text": "哦！我想提问的是实先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:867ae5099564a76e31fe9acf446649f46d6044774c94c439df6100622c832800",
      "text": "好啊，问什么都可以哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9c4b06faa10eaba731f159e1a4ed667d95f62ac35af84401d501b63c56545bd",
      "text": "有件事我一直很在意啊……\n我们很久以前是不是在什么地方见过啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5a3fcfdf49a042ee33b1406392560447e16386a751fc38c6e5dc0b966f3e4f6",
      "text": "和朱雀君吗？……唔，是这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ced490995614b7f532b6e98974dce5e425cda747420b91fbeabdc6e0a44b13c0",
      "text": "这么说来，可能是我多心了吧。\n多谢啦，实先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_c:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db5f4ef8460ea261a88216635220e352baded9c6a225d0c25c0b137892b89d7d",
      "text": "也是会有这种事的呢。那下一个，\n由我向朱雀提问！我一直很好奇……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29e2d4f0401bbc1bd83be92a24964658a3b8dbf073ac874bd680155dfeb3b3a3",
      "text": "你的发型一直固定得很帅气呢。\n用的是哪家的发蜡啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_c:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14de2382669497c14d87d304514a67587b4788635cb3a6e1755b7c49f0dfd3ee",
      "text": "嘿嘿，谢啦！你问的是我用的发蜡吧。\n等录完了之后拿给你看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a6e333b502dcc35b624aaeb3c49f92850e7f6201f7f7974ba16d80789332622",
      "text": "真的吗！谢谢！\n那么下一位请提问吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c75fb71a17452dc35c823ca4527f1ce1dd259d969723b0afb54078c5b4e99cfa",
      "text": "那么，由我向锐心君提问可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35fb8d30576de8e04f91947454da1d89ea96a962e55ea6b9284c3227499dfc69",
      "text": "其实我对C.FIRST的大家一直很感兴趣。\n3个人都是学生会长，让人觉得非常耐人寻味呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:304383654f43f6813d2282e9f2f3fc806742b88b09ce0285c93cc79d25fa96b8",
      "text": "所以今天能一起工作，我很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22e175ce4adfe0f7a4d312248f89578954acedaaaddc14aad790565ab3a01861",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n我也很高兴能与渡边先生各位一起工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f018cb5e51aa628022df63ecb1bc8cb2bac0b5a623b76de97c8e3a2bf1bf951c",
      "text": "那么下一个可以轮到我了吗……？秋山，我看了你之前发的那段\n现场演奏视频哦！吉他独奏超级帅气！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b335a8cf260957bd6bc34b98890af3fa191fb9084e42d3607fb849458b11355",
      "text": "哎，真的吗！？……嘿嘿。\n能被你这么说，我超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cc6a0b84ce0e9fd130e9e54e25775048483c23d1830c20a9c1bc3bc2c784e8d",
      "text": "我很期待你的下一场演奏。加油啊！\n传给眉见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb85c1694d0f6398f5bf47033df042f82d59e37432910ba20c45f28ca2747ce4",
      "text": "我想向秋山和红井提问。作为同是高中生的偶像\n组合，我一直想找机会和你们两位聊聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9629a0347492583dc0cdfd6255c841cce18b934425304a3175cb710cb87fb40",
      "text": "哎，和我们！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:467d51c8b58fe132732a8c8aca111778b2785791c789223000a0371c1eb90b31",
      "text": "我也想和锐心先生聊聊看呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35accd6a47e517ecd450bec7534c974d92c1576033701b27e48dfcd6f84a9950",
      "text": "找个时间聚一聚吧。\n这件事之后再详细说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_d:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4a6dee318b0c2f24fa8475f287b67e972c781243814cf536a17bfe0d356c297",
      "text": "嗯，我很期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f17ce21180932fca79237686063b2e9cce44c4db32232a7260ce1a1479ea0cd",
      "text": "差不多该进正题了吧。大家的资料都在手边了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:603519c4925177eb4df1d9d1ec6fa5f8407e06b7f404aaf635e13cd3817bb2af",
      "text": "齐了！\n上面都写了些什么呢。让我瞧瞧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:320bd0497c88bbf945b9b33b1fc1ec8bc85b5d57177585d8994c7594c328bcc7",
      "text": "大家想看的内容，好像还挺丰富的。\n……啊，这边还有指名企划呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b63f6a29c5898eeeb908c3daabe9facd6dc5ea082c2dc0ac2c99ace0f5624ef3",
      "text": "做饭、绘画对决、还有捉迷藏吗！\n噢噢噢噢！引人注目的企划太多了，真让人纠结啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98c6e5548d8770dadcf0c131532822b1b46e7892e2f4a42dadbbae0a2be806d5",
      "text": "啊，看样子一时半会儿是定不下来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f7aa3332edaa2e201cf053061741bbef2cdf0d368a56e4c4f5ad570d20d51d5",
      "text": "那么，就由我来归纳大家的意见吧。\n可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d57075faeb85b5ffa38795f5027dc2436fa4c8e63e9bd458fb990425d8bca70",
      "text": "嗯，当然可以。\n那接下来就交给你了，锐心君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:056d511f74169a4738dd351b08982a80570c9e22a87011ba7e6019d883e6f537",
      "text": "（哇～真不愧是著名的学生会长！在这种时候，\n能唰地站出来主持大局，太帅了吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bded1d48b85006462e2d10f1b3d243fee54a5a475408f3d6bf39d128c5622a2",
      "text": "（这堂堂正正的气魄。隔着话语都能感受到，\n他绝对是在学校里当老大的料啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6e0abb4b18422d4f279a5ac6349b94ce28bacb0dca2c0c7f3598b6fd3632b07",
      "text": "其他视频里，选取的题材基本都契合了\n各个队伍自身的个性。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_e:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da41cb774145fa1af48670bccb6e57ff01c42dfb885551510461b7834e359b63",
      "text": "首先，我们也以“是否适合我们自己”为基准\n来进行挑选，各位觉得如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c16a8f8ec8c080783e388dbf6f0370705ee80121b4b902835ffb2762daac595",
      "text": "既然这样，这个企划怎么样！\n就是那个“想看各位平时的舞蹈练习”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdcbac05768ebfbd454cfb4c5445639a555a39f3faecdeb17f224df403df96d8",
      "text": "听起来挺有意思的呢。印象中好像确实\n没怎么给粉丝们展示过平时的舞蹈练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef149ba632ea31b152bd59329e647f0f0aad928769ecf2a1dfb7988e1ccf071d",
      "text": "我好像也从没公开过\n自己练舞时的样子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97ff7ee2d1bdc0f64e5ddf221124d8b9999a9d10ff4d8f2ddea39c1877fa0e4a",
      "text": "虽然在其他视频里也出现过相同的桥段，\n但反响相当不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f7625cbef97fb995053c14df25285d497257e1414990d5462fb0d1e11794bbc",
      "text": "如果我们也要做的话，\n大概需要换一种不同的切入点吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a852b9f6b0135a8901c65dc84e9beea53c838ce71c0975b051f141c7560a78fa",
      "text": "那这样呢，选一首让看这个频道的观众们\n都耳熟能详的曲子怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dfcd86f4bb4175a6bb6e297d8a7cfc7a0255c7b4271353c0dd74111391d2955",
      "text": "这个系列视频不是有3首片尾曲嘛。\n观众们应该也对MV很熟悉了，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1339f642654f3a1650f0c565a0f663b9514ac44858b1b88cbb40f29eb5d64d7",
      "text": "所以去跳另外2首片尾曲的舞蹈，\n这个企划怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f709c2a43de95925b8da7004f1ec29180f40b7546f24b0f566eeb63e0dd03624",
      "text": "哦哦，也就是展示那两首歌的练舞过程啊！\n这样一来肯定会更有趣的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000107:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e583fb19f15a72802dac751a354022915be32026a03abc48de3b7502e72dff1b",
      "text": "……这次的企划就定为这个了吧。\n那么，向观众们公布吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_f:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ccfbdb8d662fb9abbb26e6894461821fc379e09e31690b70861c60681fbf0d8",
      "text": "我们在这个视频里要挑战的企划是……这个哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b44bb3ab82bfedd76af2d0ab5731ed64f780f4f1eda150c1bd8fac8b90c28aa",
      "text": "……好，OK！\n起跳的镜头拍得非常完美哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2c0fae2935926fd7a3c941cbd1718161e0de0fa7976e71734a50a59ea6ae0aa",
      "text": "接下来只要在下一个场景也跳一下，\n把画面拼接起来就大功告成了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a66e3f989b2c0c04b10c4ca86ece3022b8fb939b256608e12c9ce0c085669d07",
      "text": "谢谢大家的配合。一直以来我都想尝试一次呢，\n就是这种起跳后瞬间转移的镜头！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea329b26fdd845b48654c07bb74fbc16fd9aca402115c2f702da4333d58da6f2",
      "text": "实先生！现在道谢可还太早啦！\n接下来可还有着陆环节呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fa276e1a7cf4a83d6be42f5c200edbbb1cbcf3a9d3384c6bbc31a77c74bbcdc",
      "text": "虽说曾见过熟人在电视上这么做，\n但真没想到自己也会有亲自尝试的一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95821c5de98addf71a28eaafdaea3df205b89effaaa35ad52b491efeb6da8b13",
      "text": "应该是我向各位致谢才是。\n这是一次很有趣的体验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d69b9a79ac28aaa7c589d295847b0df001bcf80299af5dd27c34383380e3200",
      "text": "真想快点拍完下一场，看看拼接好的视频效果啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e6b03302294f4c1219bf358aa23e326df9cd4ab0d37a034eed528b2781e6e96",
      "text": "确实！话虽这么说，其实我心里更多的是\n为前半部分顺顺利利拍完而松了一口气啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:466e3d539804217f5c939ed235081d644674e24e5b9cbe6aecf135f07f396737",
      "text": "各位，再次辛苦了。那么，\n大家最终选定的是什么样的企划呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c90a91488a5868d7a37482f25f2b580cc0ac536321434df8162cea75b8742e1e",
      "text": "对了对了。具体的企划内容，\n我们好像还没有跟●●●●プロデューサー详细说明过呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faf645c121b4e21dbed8b0bc0e7cc9a204b21c72aec8b23774fa256c6438d973",
      "text": "是的。因为需要提前确认拍摄所需的场地，\n所以希望能跟各位简单开个小会沟通一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7df063fe19aadfcc3cbe3f414206a5c0d6960276c1e902715a1c0ccbd7f75a25",
      "text": "明白了。那就由我来向您说明吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000157:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000164:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a0c376a4d52ca789655d1022f01989b5e3cb266ea3433a6ad44c931a3483c3e",
      "text": "各位，如果方便的话，\n在下次拍摄前，我们要不要\n聚在一起集训一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000166:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a63e194ee508195030113783109a8c566b6bc2d173c557a8b8a591341355871c",
      "text": "哦，这主意不错啊！\n什么时候大家能聚齐？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000168:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f831ef4f1233fc3085b1c1d899e0d0a2e655e521d205b584238898fed9b0fa3",
      "text": "我也赞成。要是办集训的话，\n配合学生们的安排选在周末可能会比较好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000170:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:184947e7cdf774f498881d0aa7db978423e848917f3b996d4fcfedc35699ec11",
      "text": "说的也是！\n大家这周末\n有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000172:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a51864fb57de11ce827ef7289b03f1459e3a5a5204bbe5b99b06a82599caac97",
      "text": "下周六的话我可以！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000174:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc65aa62e2266b22fdb236c04b0f7e83c110173a25f9bb7a1169b5af0dc8b1be",
      "text": "我周六也有空",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000176:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2dd12ae06021dea68ef118e52778d4cec5fd5cfb0e22c3eb7065dba0dd24cf3",
      "text": "那就这么定了吧<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>\n集训的内容菜单，\n能拜托给龙吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000178:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bc94d29f1da9c977a9918c46e08fa954649d63e91544bef956610c644ec1f5e",
      "text": "明白！\n就交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000180:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d3e1f3544f8ff43bfd55321c86370704d549c384e38714505de7137cdeab42d",
      "text": "哦哦太棒啦\n居然能让龙先生\n帮忙安排训练菜单！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000182:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c5f417276fb3ee83725a1811d7d2f5d6d6b99f203ab0b5757d1b3ed42a13365",
      "text": "那就拜托您了。\n我很期待当天的训练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000184:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96d7bcae2dd865e2d343d0c6c722b19dfff15503458fe37269feac4139031d57",
      "text": "感觉会非常专业呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_14</emoji>\n为了不拖后腿，\n我会加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_g:cmd-000186:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:681481fc4141c68f3d10d184d9e7abee1fb7b3fce0b0940db9325a4c3d02d7b5",
      "text": "放宽心啦！我会制定成\n像诚司先生在视频里示范过的\n新手训练菜单的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000028:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70163813c9356de69584d2c95617e0b93528186d2a8e3d11ab191a37f1abaf09",
      "text": "让大家久等了。拍摄马上开始。\n请各位站到和上次相同的位置上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad4ce4a3796cd370e1562afd13f7c0ff621f4e6150bd78f1d652e85771537197",
      "text": "……好，OK！只要原地跳起然后\n落地，应该就能和上次的画面完美衔接上了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b50c2351fa0d751f7695bca68da10e7e38496f632f00c36e75c3ac3db788e7b9",
      "text": "那么，拍摄开始！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0833fbb59d7c909e5ae635ee995682dc9f0540dc45a940235bef72312a62751",
      "text": "“在一天之内学会并跳出\n315频道的片尾曲舞蹈”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5724aa3b2cc08a3d431d9593f97bdfd8f55346eaa497f099f0ea2315aef92fd1",
      "text": "要学的，是我们所跳曲目之外的另外两首。\n而且，还附带了必须在傍晚前完成的时间限制哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35438d3be6065c98a61b22aeca2914a020d70f71a19b24d31dd69ad19e630588",
      "text": "要在傍晚前全部学会确实挺有难度的，\n不过我们会努力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47f562f651686bf84eee45d3d863fdbee2d600933ce2da4a85efbc7a82196fe5",
      "text": "没问题的啦！秋山你不是在企划开始前，\n就已经看过其他片尾曲的编舞视频了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f8142e9aa752507a2ca21c93e05fd5107711b8584760bb1bf4256632a3310d1",
      "text": "只要跳起来，身体自然而然就会跟着动起来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000176:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bef80a22b423628dc298e7d7b2d0a0c7125d4377269252a07552c51d7445f4e4",
      "text": "好嘞，那就立刻开工吧！\n噢噢噢，放马过来吧！Burning！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000183:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_h:cmd-000218:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca7bcf0c4ffa9a043e7c4d4678c9b3d9d1e2c90e4a3461a2d2b4d83491157d1b",
      "text": "各位，休息时间到了！记得要好好\n补充水分哦！休息结束后就是正式演出了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ee3a8eed57413ba35bdef9f9971179dabd91446402a344e8fcbe312513ec1f3",
      "text": "……啊！糟了！仔细想想，我这还是\n第一次在粉丝面前展现这种打扮呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63a7ad37322e53c378bf616bfc7618edc1289e449ae7b6cd45e1c3d1d8152b95",
      "text": "你们两个，我看起来有没有哪里怪怪的？\n或者说，真的适合我吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:972c2f91c5092d72bf1de8c024aeba9e28f3a06409dcb1073c3d830eb979f102",
      "text": "秋山。事到如今才问这个，未免太迟了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c7694af25f9188f96bbd9073676bf3d803a4a9bbf07094fdaa09b298e8d9020",
      "text": "真是的。和你平时在演出时弹吉他的样子相比，\n简直判若两人啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa31aa29d3db460babedee2777208ddaa3b8e39bc546f773bdfda169f1ff92fb",
      "text": "哎！锐心，你看过我们的演出吗！？\n谢谢，我超开心的！……不对，现在不是说这个的时候！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11df6c111fe7eb97c636a1d163a25788e13127984a817c89344f2e7e7c4684d3",
      "text": "马上就要正式开拍了耶！？会介意也是理所当然的吧！\n我也想让大家看到自己帅气的一面啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e071848654019968e1712564dd6ae18647e60971a55578f3fb1e78cf4425437",
      "text": "没事的啦，隼人先生！\n无论是这身行头还是发型，都帅得无懈可击！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea30a362f1e20893b81445180e1d1102ee08487a5349cb798076dffc48d57bdb",
      "text": "真的吗？太好了……发型也是\n多亏了从朱雀那里借来的发蜡呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7055fd927699d1d553678cedfb2a1709ff8c4c4fe994d62e6c7eb6506011d77b",
      "text": "之前你好像也提过这件事。\n那东西真有这么好用吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ea5f43e1e4db3a25d7b497b2d09df4a3a61df8fa0b427a10331ddd6518b9d39",
      "text": "是啊，抓型效果绝了！\n锐心先生，不介意的话要不要也用用看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:982699386813aeedd912700363a10e816fdb7ab4fa1474857f94d40c09d61969",
      "text": "那么，我就稍微借用一下。\n……原来如此，用起来的手感确实不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed9098e5a45a81b683c11dbaf8ba6830d7351423df71e0d1d85a9486a435138b",
      "text": "嘿嘿，是吧？毕竟可是本大爷的爱用品啊。\n顺便问问，锐心先生平时都用什么样的啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eacf4aef8fd93efe6a9d8ea8c40b3cc29156fa99f94d528579c0b22af992ee16",
      "text": "都是父母或熟人推荐给我的款式。\n我自己倒没有特别的讲究……不过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_i:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c1504e72a03151d4be2be5b29794c7181c8540e81cb1e14e185960fc2e5c58d",
      "text": "唯独会注意不要让香味太浓。\n特别是在与人一同用餐的时候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9130d9bc90b8167b71a6b45fc803d14f09160f1bcdd2c75578a0322379303dc0",
      "text": "那三个人，感情变得越来越好了呢。\n毕竟是同龄人，果然更容易合得来吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95a1fdca463897b770303c094962c8c543b1ddb3b0bf67e112ad3b466550ebfd",
      "text": "这应该也是原因之一，不过那三个人里，\n有乐队队长、",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7f9268fc791350da5ab570b3ea99ade4e5afdb9f04477aba63bac5a62eba7cb",
      "text": "有学校老大的搭档，还有学生会长，\n可能也是因为各自的立场让他们很有共同语言吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c42c93fb41f13629c370aba0c9fd13266e1d52445fb3913f0976426c24899293",
      "text": "确实如此呢。不过单就年龄来说，\n龙先生其实也和他们差不了多少吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c071f4ac2353009f76b2000346207e0f29daf54acc23981bf3045343af286364",
      "text": "年龄最接近的是锐心君吧。\n既然只差两岁，按说应该也会很有共同话题才对？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe359311ac1bbf9abf070f9f1ba4b5cb1969ed5b639aee7a92c63cf6e03ae889",
      "text": "哎呀，其实并不是那样哦。\n相差两个年级的差距可大了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27942cfd883dcc62e0b1f47fb6cb349114e02e02e6714a4c84453deef0fa0c7b",
      "text": "现在流行的事情，\n跟我还是学生的时候完全不一样，让我吓了一跳呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b12911b7d45fa9d442a7a154e946abd15e1b70a8cac2009a6d94ac8c6043b96e",
      "text": "哈哈。那要是换成我掺和进去，\n岂不是会让他们吓得更厉害了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df76cd49bcba0f0a56753ccdbf9b5e8d0cc6041d92902158bbdbf92f4f5a5294",
      "text": "渡边先生、木村先生。我们的准备已经就绪了。\n可以开始正式拍摄了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdc0d89be8be1514f82336f8d34179741682860591248680ee42f712aa13a8c2",
      "text": "哎呀，已经到这个时间啦！\n不好意思，不知不觉就聊入迷了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3fe0cfcf10e9a36d02baac7d7249cb11b47c3e203946eb2fbc6d4b1aee7f60",
      "text": "那个，我突然觉得……龙先生和实先生，\n关系真的很要好呢。刚才也聊得很开心的样子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8ed6c2ca6187a55ce9de1cb128a1bd3812401d0ec8151f07c4cc0d79388e0f6",
      "text": "对啊，本大爷也是这么觉得的。\n果然这就是所谓的成年人之间更容易有共同话题吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dbafe3cf9a0ec3fcdcbfe3426fe5df615ba79cb352079c71e9070476fcdd2bb",
      "text": "……哈哈。看来你们三个，也跟我们\n在琢磨同样的事情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41a7e4a67d828053360db22433b53835c77f16abbd16476d83ed2f51769802fe",
      "text": "“也”？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_j:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8beb1879d7489922139000a0b4b8ce794ed99a4d360559c68f8f0c23b6acce3b",
      "text": "没事，只是刚才我们也在聊着，\n觉得那三个高中生关系真好呢。感觉两边挺像的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24e679ce363a221d7ad8bcaa3abab2e41d86340027302be635c76fc6d25cfd5a",
      "text": "视频正式拍摄中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f95830d21fc0d7be4656a11bfc7bf1df146f502ed211ee0ed29d4fc78d1b462",
      "text": "（很好，第2首歌也顺利结束了。接下来\n只要把第3首歌的舞蹈跳完……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab0ef0ae30d46aef3d5b86eef7ec80b9ec54f4114efdf4dac436d15dfcd2b9df",
      "text": "（第2首歌的时候，感觉自己的动作差点要跟不上大家了……\n第3首歌必须要加油才行！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e861e7ffd9a2f933183b13f72724614808ee847c09ed21cdf809c6848785b487",
      "text": "（好嘞，目前为止感觉都非常棒！\n最后一首也保持这股势头，一定要大获全胜！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a27691130444e482826b7f871442a4c948de4abd7a88303d048aa44ac743139",
      "text": "（……唔！真不愧是大家，太厉害了。\n完全看不出刚才跳了那么久舞蹈练习的疲惫感呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1210f851cf8c5204deb9aa37a800d5704ffa2213c3ecf60c978bfc1fa77c239",
      "text": "（不过，我也有身为最年长者的骨气在。\n必须向大家证明年龄的差距根本算不了什么才行……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4a9ffde73f5bae7f9f6d647a551e6aec317d5252538df68b78d167e79f35ada",
      "text": "（很好，大家的状态似乎都还能坚持。这样的话，\n顺利跳完整首歌应该不成问题）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55aea82c7cbd6e4458d2852fd8cdaa8099dd71ce04869cadea894edd0e3ef0b8",
      "text": "（还剩最后一首！鞋带……看起来没问题！\n拜托了，一定要撑到最后啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:986fce93e532b378b1d56bc0a5d3a1c6dc8f3f555f984683c5ff32ce0e96adf3",
      "text": "……好耶！完美跳到最后啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000215:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ac1ca5beecb800c454c7863874b4e1f262308694c1e4ee5152e008210dd1822",
      "text": "呼……是啊。\n总算是坚持跳完了，太好了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000238:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88f8567f590956572fcf0d95bdc1cbf5e2c80db02aa1ce30f2b7ba2fe5736c3",
      "text": "虽说中途有一瞬间节奏乱了，\n但整体完成度很高。我认为大家跳得非常出色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000245:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08f50c24c4acfa80af1d1e2813b65dcade9e6cbd9916c70f006c6dcd40d68317",
      "text": "太好了，我们全部跳完了哦！\n大家都有好好看着吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000252:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bc59ff72f3e467a875a1f5cfb35c2a31e48e6db08b991d890a56ce570e20193",
      "text": "希望大家能够喜欢这个视频！\n各位，非常感谢一直看到最后的你们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000289:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2a05cd3ee19d5796758b49a46ff8826c647d5dbc0da91a8b7ac69b897638252",
      "text": "也请好好期待下一批成员带来的视频哦。\n再见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000507:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1033caff1fdc9c13dbaa6d678ce27f786061a8e31af6fc13031d68d5f073f053",
      "text": "工作辛苦了，\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000509:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9be9c8a270368b9edcc67c662968227eae573512149e1ef58a41f4458c7250e7",
      "text": "今天终于到了我们视频发布的期待之日啦！\n我从好几天前就开始兴奋得不得了了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000511:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85b46248749c1855c47f9a8be72d4fed113e6cb8300d5cc17e32b53e62f6320c",
      "text": "制作人之前不是说要一起看嘛，\n工作快忙完了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000513:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea500ab837476af986a9ce307cb2ee8d20d6aa91283d30be1b0e3667ebbda82b",
      "text": "马上就结束了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000516:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eda331e6c60d1e63f3d4c31877a09206a0f09702fc2bdf70cc0c49957ad377f",
      "text": "那可太好了！我现在正和龙先生他们往事务所走。\n估计会比预定时间稍微早到一些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000518:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3308260c1195bd8fd62ba214a5fea8951c02b5fc44c56cdc30a7765cf9f80d81",
      "text": "听说其他人也马上就到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000520:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e51913ddff4974390380c9bb698a8da22cc3f80a5e4077745c15885cd06507f2",
      "text": "所以说啊，大家就聊着说要不要去看看\n只有现在才能看到的粉丝们的实时反应。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000522:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53509f7d551953d52eed2650b9a9be8f53fe5f3857e6e631d4b58872b9abd060",
      "text": "那些等着看直播的人，\n现在肯定正因为猜成员而聊得热火朝天吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000524:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8722097764a64068b9e66be0efaddf692334c99d3e4794b1a0a1624551ce830c",
      "text": "只要你手头的工作忙完了就行，\n制作人也一起过来看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000526:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7af85b76a21fb636d7a4d98cb6ccd1ea50128b3f5751e7d902b1ac985258e241",
      "text": "大家也都说想听听你的想法呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_k:cmd-000528:phone_message:000": {
